.TH ROOT-GUI 1 "October 2026" "Root 0.1.0-rc.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
root-gui \- graphical desktop interface for Root resource inspection
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B root-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B root-gui
is the native desktop interface for Root, built with GTK4 and Libadwaita. It presents an intuitive, responsive graphical visualization of system telemetry, memory distribution, coding agent footprints, and active processes.
.PP
The graphical interface connects directly to the core Rust platform engine without requiring background daemons, cloud connections, or administrative privileges.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+1 .. Ctrl+7
Navigate directly across views (Overview, Resources, Agents, Processes, Activity, Schedule, Settings).
.TP
.B Ctrl+R, F5
Refresh system telemetry and process snapshot immediately.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Gracefully quit the application.
